<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Fight for the International Hotel</title>
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #222;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .poster-container {
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    padding: 15px 15px 35px 15px;
    position: relative;
    max-width: 700px;
    width: 100%;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .poster-inner {
    background-color: #111;
    padding: 15px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  /* Typography */
  .poster-inner div {
    font-family: 'Arial Black', Impact, sans-serif;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Header */
  .header-en {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 3.8rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .header-en span:first-child {
    font-size: 3.2rem;
  }
  .header-tl {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    border-top: 2px solid #fff;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
    padding: 4px 0;
    margin: 4px 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .header-es {
    color: #d96c36;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  /* Illustration Block */
  .illustration-block {
    border: 2px solid #d96c36;
    background-color: #f0e6d2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin: 5px 0;
  }
  .zh-title {
    color: #111;
    font-family: 'KaiTi', 'STKaiti', serif !important;
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    padding: 10px 0;
    letter-spacing: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .placeholder {
    height: 320px;
    background-color: #d96c36;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-top: 2px solid #111;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #111;
  }
  .placeholder-text {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    color: #111;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    font-family: sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .zh-subtitle {
    color: #111;
    font-family: 'KaiTi', 'STKaiti', serif !important;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  /* Footer Text */
  .footer-text-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    text-align: left !important;
    padding: 0 2px;
  }
  .footer-text-container div {
    text-align: left !important;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .text-orange {
    color: #d96c36;
  }
  .text-white {
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* Margin Notes */
  .margin-notes {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 10px;
    left: 15px;
    right: 15px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: #444;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="poster-container">
  <div class="poster-inner">

    <div class="header-en">
      <span>FIGHT FOR THE</span>
      <span>INTERNATIONAL HOTEL</span>
    </div>

    <div class="header-tl">
      IPAGLABAN ANG INTERNATIONAL HOTEL
    </div>

    <div class="header-es">
      LUCHA POR EL HOTEL INTERNACIONAL
    </div>

    <div class="illustration-block">
      <div class="zh-title">保衛國際旅店</div>
      <div class="placeholder">
        <span class="placeholder-text">[Illustration: Three older individuals, two men and one woman, centered]</span>
      </div>
      <div class="zh-subtitle">
        <span>平價住屋人人有權</span>
        <span>反對迫遷我們有理</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-text-container">
      <div class="text-orange">
        VIVIENDA DECENTE Y BARATA ES EL DERECHO DE TODO HUMANO.<br>
        ES JUSTO PROTESTAR CONTRA LA EVICCIÓN.
      </div>
      <div class="text-orange">
        KARAPATAN NG LAHAT ANG MABABANG PAUPOPAHAN.<br>
        KARAPATAN NATIN LABANAN.
      </div>
      <div class="text-white">
        DECENT LOW-INCOME HOUSING IS EVERYBODYS RIGHT.<br>
        IT IS RIGHT TO REBEL AGAINST EVICTION.
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="margin-notes">
    <span>JOIN THE PHONE TREE! CALL 982-4244</span>
    <span>LABOR DONATED - NOT FOR SALE - San Francisco Poster Brigade [illegible]</span>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
